cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Prior- and constraint-driven directed-evolution agent (GB1 four-site landscape)
message: If you refer to this work, please cite the repository.
type: software
authors:
  - name: Sunrich-HT
version: 2.0.0
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/Sunrich-HT/gb1-directed-evolution-agent
abstract: >-
  A controlled comparison of seven batch-selection strategies on the GB1 four-site
  fitness landscape, testing whether an evidence prior compiled from structures and
  published literature, plus explicit non-sequence constraints, outperforms a fitted
  predictor and whether a language model adds anything on top of them.
keywords:
  - directed evolution
  - protein fitness landscape
  - active learning
  - interpretability
